# Canonical link-journal transition table.
#
# Fields are separated by "|":
# name | from | to | role | trigger | flags | guard
#
# This is the only hand-edited transition table. Run
# `python3 tools/generate_link_transitions.py` after changing it.

arm | EMPTY | ARMED | EITHER | LOCAL_ARM | ADMISSION,CANCELABLE | compatible SIO snapshot and no active transfer
cancel_arm | ARMED | EMPTY | EITHER | LOCAL_CANCEL | RECOVERY_SAFE | no decision has ever been recorded for the sequence
issue_decision | ARMED | DECIDED | HOST | BOTH_ARMS | IMMUTABLE_HASH | both compatible arms are present and the host issues the canonical hash
record_decision | ARMED | DECIDED | JOINER | DECISION | IMMUTABLE_HASH | nonce epoch sequence and hash match the host-issued decision
replay_decision | DECIDED | DECIDED | EITHER | DECISION | IDEMPOTENT,IMMUTABLE_HASH | the complete decision identity and hash match the recorded decision
mark_released | DECIDED | RELEASED | HOST | DECISION_ACK | IDEMPOTENT | the acknowledgement matches the immutable decision
record_release | DECIDED | RELEASED | JOINER | RELEASE | IDEMPOTENT | the release matches the immutable decision
replay_release | RELEASED | RELEASED | EITHER | RELEASE | IDEMPOTENT | the release identity and hash match the recorded release
clear_released | RELEASED | EMPTY | EITHER | RELEASE_SHARED | CHECKPOINT | both peers have observed the released sequence and local data and IRQ were applied at most once
recover_cancel_arm | ARMED | EMPTY | EITHER | RECOVERY_EMPTY | RECOVERY_SAFE | peers report the same released checkpoint and neither reports a decision
recover_decision | ARMED | DECIDED | JOINER | RECOVERY_DECISION | IMMUTABLE_HASH,RECOVERY_SAFE | the host journal proves it issued the exact peer decision
recover_release | DECIDED | RELEASED | EITHER | RECOVERY_RELEASE | IDEMPOTENT,RECOVERY_SAFE | both peers report the same decision and the host journal proves issuance
recover_empty | EMPTY | EMPTY | EITHER | RECOVERY_CHECKPOINT | IDEMPOTENT,CHECKPOINT,RECOVERY_SAFE | both peers report the same released checkpoint and no active decision
recover_released | RELEASED | EMPTY | EITHER | RECOVERY_CHECKPOINT | IDEMPOTENT,CHECKPOINT,RECOVERY_SAFE | both peers report the same released decision and local application is complete
